msgctxt "80"
msgid "Holy shit, you're strong... We're gettin' outta here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Thanks, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Akira! What the heck are you doing, huh!? I've been worried sick about you, "
"you know that!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"...Shut up, okay? I don't need you breathing down my neck all the time! I'm "
"not a kid anymore, you know!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "*<Italic>Whack</Italic>!*"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "Owwww! What the hell!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Kiryu-san!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "You think that's really the best way to react in this situation?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"I just wanted to make fast money, that's all... Especially since Dad's dead "
"and all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Akira..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"I knew it was dangerous, I just... I never thought something like this "
"could happen to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Akira... Look how far we've made it, even without our dad around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"We'll be fine from here on out, too! We're family, Akira. We stick "
"together, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Saya..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "...Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Thanks a bunch. <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "He was trying to help, just not in the right way..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "Mm-hmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Kiryu-san... I've decided something!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "I'm not gonna go to Tokyo after all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "...Really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "Yeah! My family cares about me, and I care about them a whole lot, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Despite all that, I can't stop thinking about my dad not being around..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Don't take this to mean I'm giving up on becoming a model, though!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "Heh, I won't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "Good! 'Cause I'll make it to Tokyo when the time is right!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "But for now, I'm gonna live with my family here in Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "I think that's great. You should do what you think is right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "I will. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid ""
"Y'know, it'll be a while till I get to Tokyo... So don't you dare think "
"about cheating on me, okay? <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "Heh... We'll see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "Hmph!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid ""
"If you're not gonna promise me that... Could I have you all to myself today "
"instead?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid ""
"C'mon... Pretty please? "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255"
">⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid ""
"I ran into Akira on the street, but before I could talk to him, this car "
"pulled up next to us..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid "...And they grabbed Akira, then sped off!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid "Where'd they go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid "They were headed towards Ryukyu Boulevard, I think..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san... We've gotta do something..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid "We sure will. Let's follow them. Think you can keep up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "Yeah, I think so!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid "Akira!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid "Saya!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid "Saya? What, you his big sister or somethin'?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid "What do you think you're doing!? Let him go, right now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid "Heh... Y'know, your sister's quite the looker, Akira."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid ""
"Hey, sweetheart. I know a club who'd love to have your hot bod rakin' in "
"the cash for 'em."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid "Leave her alone! She's got nothing to do with this, okay!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid "Shut the hell up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid "Ugh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid "Heh... You in the biz too, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "992"
msgid "We were using this kid as a mule... But damn, if he don't keep messin' up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1004"
msgid "We're here to make him pay for those mistakes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid "I don't know what your deal is, but you'd better let him go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid ""
"Hehehe. Who do you think you are, some kinda superhero? You here to save "
"the day?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid "Well, I sure as hell didn't call your sorry ass!"
msgstr ""

